# Blog restoration working files.
# NEVER commit the WordPress dump: it carries 2 password hashes, 543 email
# addresses, Gravity Forms entries and sent-mail records. It stays on the
# Desktop and is read in place. The extracted post JSON is safe (post content
# only) and is committed so the restore is reproducible.
_restore/*.sql
